(d)  the circumstances in which a crew agreement or a copy of an agreement, shall
be carried in a ship;

(e)  the requirements for a crew agreement, or a copy of an agreement, to be
delivered to an authorised officer;

(f)  the requirement for a crew agreement or a copy of an agreement, to be made
available for perusal by an authorised officer;

